stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> queued
  queued --> waitingInformation: missing required field
  waitingInformation --> validating: final field received
  queued --> validating: already complete
  validating --> stored: structural validation passed
  validating --> discarded: structural validation failed
  queued --> discarded: unknown parser result
  queued --> escalated: emergency preemption
  waitingInformation --> escalated: emergency preemption
  escalated --> waitingInformation: resume pending field
  escalated --> validating: resume complete event
  stored --> [*]
  discarded --> [*]
